      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The EPBOPO avatar works correctly in live, but is broken in open beta.\n\nThe avatar's controller's logic is as follows:\n\n```\n\nTracking -> Canceling if:\n\n\"Voice\" parameter is Greater than \"0\"\n\nOR\n\n\"Viseme\" parameter is not equal to \"0\".\n\n```\n\n```\n\nCanceling -> Tracking if:\n\n\"Viseme\" parameter equals \"0\"\n\nAND\n\n\"Voice\" parameter is less than \"0.001\".\n\n```\n\nIn the debug menu, the Viseme and Voice parameters remain at 0, but it flaps between the states anyways. Remote users are not seeing this.\n\nYou can reproduce with the sample EPBOPO avatar. Use any gesture.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_836cfb6b-898b-410a-b802-bcae35b49355",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
